      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VALENCIA TILLY (2) was quickly into stride and raced on speed before drawing clear to a land a long neck win (25.18) at Sale in Bottom Up - Grade 5. Failed to fire only run here. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Can continue on her winning ways. GOT IMMUNITY (3) last start finished 6th in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 on August 12 over 300m at Healesville behind Allie beaten 4.5 lengths (17.43). Suited here and expected to run well. TWO BAYS (8) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (25.30) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. LOCKED AND READY (1) must be included in calculations.",
